```"},{"name":"mcp__codex_apps__notion_notion_convert_page_to_skill","description":"Create docs, tasks, databases

Mark an existing Notion page as a skill without changing its content. The page must be in the current workspace, and the authenticated user must have permission to edit it. Use this tool only when the user wants the page's current contents designated as a skill. This tool is part of plugin `Notion`.

